OldClock uses components and artwork from The OldOS Project by Zane Kleinberg (@zzanehip),
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Original project: https://github.com/zzanehip/The-OldOS-Project

The OldOS Project has no Clock app; OldClock is a new iOS 6 Clock built from its
components (navigation bar, bar buttons, tab bar, ON/OFF toggle, grouped tables).
Changes and additions are described in README.md and EXTRACTION.json.

Bundled resources from The OldOS Project: bar / table artwork (Assets.xcassets/Clock Icons:
BarPlus, NavBack, TableNext, RemoveMinus, ReorderGrabber, SearchGlass, TextFieldClear,
BlueCheck) and the app icon (Homescreen Icons/Clock, upscaled, Dark/Tinted derived).
The tab glyphs and the ringtones are original work made for OldClock.
The city list is derived from the IANA time zone database (public domain).
